"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I already told you of my meeting with the beast, so I will begin the second tale "
"from here—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫짐승과 저의 만남은 ⟪k:3⟫이미 ⟪k:4⟫이야기했죠.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫그러니 이야기를 시작하는 시"
"점은―― ⟪k:7⟫여기로 할게요."

