#: scenario6:scenario6_610A1B58_438B_4014_9854_20954784BA90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ff0ed3d1fadc3e173fe7c5cc8fbdd6a259c798383a51b70d5f88c52fbf41dd2
