msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_610A1B58_438B_4014_9854_20954784BA90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl lay so quietly in her bed I could not tell whether she was asleep or "
"awake. ⟪k:1⟫Even the sound of her breathing was too faint to hear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫침대에 누운 백발 소녀는 ⟪k:1⟫자는 건지 아닌 건지 구분이 안 되었어요. ⟪k:2⟫숨소리조차 안 들릴 "
"만큼 조용했죠……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_50E70F20_3762_4C28_9673_209A6BEC3F91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
