msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫그런 소녀를 바라보았어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9BD8D0C9_A667_42CB_BBA6_176213ECF1A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebd5c5a481d105b346da947af9b4af5dc732a38f34a11b6ca4390af341114a81
