msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9BD8D0C9_A667_42CB_BBA6_176213ECF1A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the locked-away despair and wails of lamentation I thought myself no longer capable of came "
"bubbling back to the surface."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러자 ⟪k:1⟫숨기고 있던 절망감이, ⟪k:2⟫진작 잃은 줄 알았던 한탄이 ⟪k:3⟫빠르게 되살아났죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DFD9106B_4AC6_4564_AB5F_2270AE250704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b94d111c40cf6619c77605e7bbe3f7f6e85a3785422271d3926003a88a98b54f
#. default-sha256: 7a4fa77d43822a397aeb25190b5753d73893f01bade5e158c963b4cc77508d5c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DFD9106B_4AC6_4564_AB5F_2270AE250704"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But can you honestly blame me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had been waiting for Michel for so long.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"She was the one thing holding me up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 뭘 어쩌겠나요. ⟪k:1⟫저는 오랫동안 미셸을 기다렸잖아요. ⟪k:2⟫그것만이 버팀목이었잖아요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_51246C68_E2BD_4555_94E1_30C4101097DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca5cb756ea9b7a8dddda162b1b1bd7a15323ed255117503946157f80fe2cb543
#. default-sha256: 4349a68e68b0f02ad7b043984a71081b8a29ed780bdb1d0d18777c5e61172472
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_51246C68_E2BD_4555_94E1_30C4101097DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was the only thing keeping my broken self from falling apart completely. ⟪k:1⟫Yet she "
"claimed not to remember me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그것만이 미친 저의 ⟪k:1⟫마지막 보루인걸요. ⟪k:2⟫그런데도 ⟪k:3⟫미셸은 또 ⟪k:4⟫기억을 못 한다잖"
"아요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7E405E73_9B4D_43A5_8BB6_676F78E81FCF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95688478022d72993695697dc8e51883eb55d381e77eda31928102695fa18e3e
#. default-sha256: 75227309e822c388ffb3f3c459bbfab3cdcf5043584d7e79cc5d8f088f1ffedd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7E405E73_9B4D_43A5_8BB6_676F78E81FCF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Did you pity her, having to go through tragedy after tragedy?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But every time she "
"showed up, she said she did not know me,⟪k:3⟫bringing me more and more grief."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫여러 차례 비극을 되풀이하는 소녀가 딱하셨나요? ⟪k:1⟫하지만 ⟪k:2⟫소녀는 몇 번을 나타나도 저를 "
"모른다 하며, ⟪k:3⟫괴롭게 했어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_B7B01D9B_3ACD_4944_B84F_F773C395BE04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa596c8eee48ae1b66372fa2b18a6acaa39d541aab536023c9c446f19eb88060
#. default-sha256: 8c89af3c02ddbbedcaa909ee8bc414d9ec118484033b934b4ffe2a7600a33beb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B7B01D9B_3ACD_4944_B84F_F773C395BE04"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had been waiting for hundreds of years. ⟪k:1⟫Waiting for her for so long, my mind slipping "
"away with every passing day, waiting and waiting and wait—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫오래도록 기다렸는데. ⟪k:2⟫미셸만을 오래도록 기다렸는데, ⟪k:3⟫미친 시간 속에서도 기"
"다렸는데, ⟪k:4⟫기다렸는데, ⟪k:5⟫기다렸――"

