msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have to be careful, or I’ll slip back to what I was then.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you weren’t here "
"holding my hand now, I..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지금이라도 방심하면 ⟪k:1⟫그 순간으로 돌아갈 것 같아요. ⟪k:2⟫당신이 ⟪k:3⟫손을 잡아 주시지 않았"
"다면, ⟪k:4⟫저는……"

